* EASYTRIEVE PLUS SAMPLE FOR THE EASYTRIEVE RESOLVER
%SAMPMAC
FILE OLDMAST
ACCT   1 9 N
FILE TRANS
TACCT  1 9 N
FILE NEWMAST
FILE SORTED
JOB INPUT (OLDMAST KEY(ACCT) +
           TRANS KEY(TACCT)) FINISH(EOJ)
IF MATCHED
   PUT NEWMAST FROM OLDMAST
   CALL SAMPUTIL USING ACCT
END-IF
PRINT RPT1
SORT NEWMAST TO SORTED USING ACCT
REPORT RPT1
LINE ACCT
